# Row I2.5: declined consent. What each round runs without is the recruiter's read alone (decision 5); every other
# role gets not-found; the gate stops the guest, anon and a Work-only person (403).
GET /api/interviews/consent-effects | interviewer interviewer2 hiringManager guest=403 anon=403 workOnly=403 | recruiter
# The panel's read of the answers (what is off, never the answers' times): the panel side of the round only.
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoDesign}/consents | interviewer2 guest=403 guest:aikoCoding=403 anon=403 workOnly=403 | interviewer recruiter
